  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="page-header" style="padding: 140px 0 60px;"><div class="bg-gradient-animated"></div><div class="container"><p style="color:#93c5fd; font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600;">BLOG</p><h1 style="font-size:2.6rem; font-weight:800; color:#fff; margin:0.5rem 0 1rem;">Power BI Dashboard for Video Reviews</h1><p style="font-size:1.15rem; color:#cbd5e1; max-width:700px;">How AnalyzeG delivers review intelligence through Power BI — sentiment, keywords, demographics, and raw data.</p><div class="header-accent"></div></div></section>
    <section style="background:#fff; padding:60px 0;"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px; line-height:1.8; color:#475569; font-size:1.05rem;">
      <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Power BI is the industry standard for business intelligence dashboards. AnalyzeG integrates with Power BI to deliver verified video review intelligence in a format your team already uses — no new tools to learn.</p>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">What's in the Dashboard</h2>
      <div style="display:grid; gap:0.75rem; margin:1.5rem 0;">
        <p style="color:#475569;"><strong>Sentiment Overview:</strong> Positive / neutral / negative distribution with trend charts</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;"><strong>Keyword Themes:</strong> Top topics extracted from video content, frequency analysis</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;"><strong>Demographic Breakdown:</strong> Sentiment by state, age group, and gender</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;"><strong>Competitor Mentions:</strong> Which competitors are mentioned, in what context</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;"><strong>Video Gallery:</strong> Click any data point to watch the source video</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;"><strong>Raw Data Export:</strong> CSV/Excel with all fields, video links included</p>
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e293b; margin:2rem 0 1rem;">Why Power BI, Not a Custom Dashboard</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Your team already knows Power BI. The dashboard template connects to your existing data sources — combine review intelligence with sales data, web analytics, and ad performance in a single view.</p>
      <p style="margin-bottom:2rem;">No vendor lock-in. No new SaaS subscription. Export to Excel, share via Teams, embed in SharePoint — Power BI is your data hub.</p>
      <div style="background:#f0f9ff; border:1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius:12px; padding:2rem; margin:2rem 0;"><h3 style="font-size:1.2rem; font-weight:700; color:#1e40af; margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Get the Dashboard</h3><p style="margin-bottom:1rem;">500 verified videos with Power BI dashboard from ₹5,00,000.</p><a href="https://app.analyzeg.co.in/" style="display:inline-block; background:#2563EB; color:#fff; padding:12px 24px; border-radius:8px; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">Launch App &rarr;</a></div>
